{"availability":"available","full":"OpenUploading/CogniFold","name":"CogniFold","description":"An exploration to always on proactive memory. Design Philosophy — \"imperfection by design\"","category":"Design","language":"Python","stars":62,"forks":9,"created":"2026-05-13T01:11:59Z","updated":"2026-08-25T00:34:44Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"http://arxiv.org/abs/2605.13438","topics":[],"demo":"https://opennorve.github.io/CogniFold/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T20:09:39.890Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T20:09:39.890Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T20:09:39.890Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T14:32:57.285Z","stars":61,"forks":9},{"at":"2026-10-04T16:11:41.050Z","stars":61,"forks":9},{"at":"2026-10-06T16:32:06.613Z","stars":61,"forks":9},{"at":"2026-10-08T20:09:39.890Z","stars":62,"forks":9}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A brain-inspired always-on agent memory that folds continuously arriving events into self-emerging cognitive structure — designed for the next generation of proactive assistants. Neural-inspired by design: memory systems are mapped to the brain regions that implement them, not metaphorically borrowed.","🧠 Brain Memory Coverage: 60% of the human memory taxonomy modeled (working, episodic, semantic, prospective, temporal) — see the live breakdown at opennorve.github.io/CogniFold or query GET /api/v1/brain/coverage.","🌐 Live progress track · 🏗️ Architecture · 🚀 Deploy · 🔌 Integrations · ✍️ Prompt Profiles · 🧭 Philosophy · 🧭 North Star"],"features":["🔮 Proactive Memory. Proactivity is a property of the memory substrate, not the agent's policy — goals emerge from the topology that accumulates the conditions for them.","🧠 Architecture. A tri-layered substrate extending Complementary Learning Systems with a prefrontal Intent layer — events fold into concepts, concepts crystallize into intents, surfaced through a hierarchical context…","🌱 Conceptual Bootstrapping. Accumulation, compression, decay, completion — four structural debts of a streaming event log, resolved as transparent graph rewrites: test-time learning without gradient updates or surface…","📊 Evaluation. CogEval-Bench isolates proactive emergence from retrieval accuracy; seven downstream benchmarks confirm the substrate stays robust on conventional memory tasks."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/OpenUploading/CogniFold/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"629f787a0f3888b51b2eee4c4ec6fe751196b1d18411267ef17e49651c0099ef","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T06:26:10.719Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T10:47:48.055Z","overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-08-25T00:34:44Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T10:47:48.059Z","overviewAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T10:41:32.988Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A brain-inspired always-on agent memory that folds continuously arriving events into self-emerging cognitive structure — designed for the next generation of proactive assistants. Neural-inspired by design: memory systems are mapped to the brain regions that implement them, not metaphorically borrowed.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/OpenUploading/CogniFold/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"A brain-inspired always-on agent memory that folds continuously arriving events into self-emerging cognitive structure — designed for the next generation of proactive assistants. Neural-inspired by design: memory systems are mapped to the brain regions that implement them, not metaphorically borrowed.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/OpenUploading/CogniFold/blob/main/README.md"}],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"629f787a0f3888b51b2eee4c4ec6fe751196b1d18411267ef17e49651c0099ef","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/OpenUploading/CogniFold/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-03T10:47:48.055Z"},"readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/OpenUploading/CogniFold/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-03T10:47:48.056Z","hash":"629f787